// CLAIM:  `chunks(it, n)` / `windows(it, n)` each yield a `Vec[T]` per pull (non-overlapping / overlapping windows).
// GUIDE:  19 (Stages) / 25 (cost model: they materialize a Vec per pull, heavier than a tuple)
